{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1299.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"3d138a62c929e2b342f262004e39c0cd8b1b1e239dbb6b8ae7596e535ad70638","ja":"挑戦者現る！","zh":"挑战者登场！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1299.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"3af7f9417e370095398ea65d9eba6551328d43b1e52e7701d3ecaf7db9ceca11","ja":"みんなに新しいお仕事のオファーが来た。\nそれは新たなダンスバトルの依頼で……","zh":"大家接到了新工作的邀约。\n那是关于一场全新街舞对决的委托……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1299.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"821d934e14b06a0a061f29dd52dacd56ad48d667ab731278e2a1e66234ca2177","ja":"今度はプロダンサーチームと戦うのよね！","zh":"这次是要和职业舞者队对决对吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1299.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"36400fb3e35c5a47d4f3adbc0f622ff8d8c6db326571b558ef13f865e6f76053","ja":"ああ！　向こうの方から挑戦状を\n突きつけてくるなんて、熱い展開だよな！","zh":"啊啊！对方竟然主动下了战书，\n真是让人热血沸腾的发展啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1299.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"4c4f6efd17606c5da765429c4823be6e57c37ca06ffa51e1dae34c274d248d35","ja":"でも、相手はプロよ。\nそう簡単に勝てる相手じゃないわよね……。","zh":"不过，对方可是职业选手。\n可不是那么容易就能赢的对手呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1299.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"c2c3143f1016b922c815f87820070a2d16d45a3896fc53830b401dbd19045482","ja":"たしかに、手ごわい相手だろうね。","zh":"确实是个难缠的对手呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1299.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"4b899fcaac21177afa3ddb596b69b00a7355638aad2b5a7f4c52d512c96a9592","ja":"でも、アタシたちだって、あのセクシービースト率いる\nチームに勝ったんだ！","zh":"不过，我们也是赢过那个性感野兽率领的\n队伍的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1299.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"7abbd289508ef39dca79a2c75a575091306f78ffb667429c2b772164b19c250d","ja":"そ、そうよね！　相手がダンスのプロでも、\n挑まれたんだから受けて立つしかないわよね！","zh":"没、没错呢！就算对方是舞蹈职业选手，\n既然被挑衅了，那就只能应战了对吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1299.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"bbe647509676ca5060874921254f5077cd5bc1991b4b1ed7563f7300f9fbde46","ja":"わかってるじゃない！　どんな挑戦者が相手だって、\n私たちは全力を尽くすのみよ！","zh":"很懂嘛！不论对手是怎样的挑战者，\n我们只要全力以赴就行了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1299.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"a6bbb7d6d853ff6882d9951d9c9cd725b97cab6e9f409fab29d14371f20d0c70","ja":"そのためにも、またたくさん練習しなきゃ！\n私、練習メニューを考えますね！","zh":"为了这一点，也必须多加练习才行！\n我来考虑练习菜单吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1299.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"f24293d197f9535e3eb73cf2c86981e6d27be4beccc21d818c52e09dc1129f45","ja":"アイドルのダンスがプロに負けてないってところ、\n見せつけてやろうぜ！","zh":"让大家见识一下，\n偶像的舞蹈绝不输给专业人士！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1299.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"05227e58eda0f133554848166c0dd0273d6ef8c5deb550cc451dbad35356e541","ja":"ああ！　本番までにみんなの\nダンスレベルをもう一段階あげていこう！","zh":"好！在正式演出前，\n把大家的舞蹈水平再提升一个档次吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1299.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"20579da71925de41876080f1b03bc4629a47465fc8cd959139604e7e5b22cce5","ja":"ふふっ、いいわよ。どーんと来なさい！","zh":"呵呵，来吧。尽管放马过来！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1299.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"4db1d0fa0ab6f2b560ca2ba908361f062f8c37d24678555d3f511ed561a8aa9a","ja":"へへっ！　みんなとなら、全然負ける気がしないよ！\n待ってろよ、プロダンサーチーム！","zh":"嘿嘿！只要和大家在一起，我可一点都不觉得自己会输！\n等着瞧吧，专业舞者队！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1299.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"890f38e4b771d0d72eb2900122a101c2104766e47ba6505e68693a74ec5f8143","ja":"そうと決まったら、早速対策を練らなきゃ。\n相手のダンスVTRもらってるから、観てみましょ♪","zh":"既然决定了，就得赶紧制定对策才行。\n拿到对手的舞蹈录像了，来看看吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
